  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Integrate Perplexity AI responses into Camunda-based business processes",
    "splashDescription": "The Perplexity AI connector for Camunda lets you query advanced AI models directly from Camunda-based processes. Use it to send prompts, receive intelligent responses, and automate decision-making in processes without writing custom code. It leverages the official HTTP JSON connector to communicate with the Perplexity API and supports flexible use on service tasks, start events, and intermediate events.",
